{
  "items": [
    {
      "id": "hermitage-20210604-01",
      "threadId": "hermitage-history",
      "groupId": "hermitage-20210604",
      "senderId": "luoyao-bookstore",
      "text": "店主你好，我是刚才在商品《道教命籍与民间禳解文化研究》下面留言的罗尧。"
    },
    {
      "id": "hermitage-20210604-02",
      "threadId": "hermitage-history",
      "groupId": "hermitage-20210604",
      "senderId": "hermitage",
      "text": "您好，看到了。您想找的是书里引用的那部旧抄本《续算杂录》，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": "hermitage-20210604-09",
      "threadId": "hermitage-history",
      "groupId": "hermitage-20210604",
      "senderId": "luoyao-bookstore",
      "text": "对。我搜到你家店铺里有上过《续算杂录》的前两卷，但已经下架了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "hermitage-20210604-03",
      "threadId": "hermitage-history",
      "groupId": "hermitage-20210604",
      "senderId": "luoyao-bookstore",
      "text": "我想看看是否有关于「寄岁」的那部分，有没有更完整的记载。"
    },
    {
      "id": "hermitage-20210604-04",
      "threadId": "hermitage-history",
      "groupId": "hermitage-20210604",
      "senderId": "hermitage",
      "text": "《续算杂录》相传是明末观复道人撰，不过作者真名和成书年代都不太好考证。"
    },
    {
      "id": "hermitage-20210604-05",
      "threadId": "hermitage-history",
      "groupId": "hermitage-20210604",
      "senderId": "hermitage",
      "text": "目前能查到的基本都是残抄和转引，没见过可靠的全本。我们店里的两卷并未售出，只是现在已经不可外借了，需要店主确认授权才可以到店里阅览。"
    },
    {
      "id": "hermitage-20210604-10",
      "threadId": "hermitage-history",
      "groupId": "hermitage-20210604",
      "senderId": "luoyao-bookstore",
      "text": "原来你不是hermitage店主？"
    },
    {
      "id": "hermitage-20210604-11",
      "threadId": "hermitage-history",
      "groupId": "hermitage-20210604",
      "senderId": "hermitage",
      "text": "是的，我是这里的店员。"
    },
    {
      "id": "hermitage-20210604-12",
      "threadId": "hermitage-history",
      "groupId": "hermitage-20210604",
      "senderId": "luoyao-bookstore",
      "text": "怎么称呼？另外，我该怎么联系到这位店主？"
    },
    {
      "id": "hermitage-20210604-13",
      "threadId": "hermitage-history",
      "groupId": "hermitage-20210604",
      "senderId": "hermitage",
      "text": "我姓宁，您直接和我沟通即可。"
    },
    {
      "id": "hermitage-20210604-14",
      "threadId": "hermitage-history",
      "groupId": "hermitage-20210604",
      "senderId": "luoyao-bookstore",
      "text": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "hermitage-20210604-06",
      "threadId": "hermitage-history",
      "groupId": "hermitage-20210604",
      "senderId": "luoyao-bookstore",
      "text": "这本书现存的其他卷次还有可能找到吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": "hermitage-20210604-15",
      "threadId": "hermitage-history",
      "groupId": "hermitage-20210604",
      "senderId": "hermitage",
      "text": "您是指搜到的雨沐斋那份残卷？"
    },
    {
      "id": "hermitage-20210604-16",
      "threadId": "hermitage-history",
      "groupId": "hermitage-20210604",
      "senderId": "luoyao-bookstore",
      "text": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "hermitage-20210604-17",
      "threadId": "hermitage-history",
      "groupId": "hermitage-20210604",
      "senderId": "hermitage",
      "text": "雨沐斋主人是我店老朋友，这份残卷我们可以帮您借到。"
    },
    {
      "id": "hermitage-20210604-18",
      "threadId": "hermitage-history",
      "groupId": "hermitage-20210604",
      "senderId": "luoyao-bookstore",
      "text": "谢谢。麻烦你再帮忙留意一下其他可能获得的渠道。"
    },
    {
      "id": "hermitage-20210604-07",
      "threadId": "hermitage-history",
      "groupId": "hermitage-20210604",
      "senderId": "hermitage",
      "text": "可以帮您留意，但不能保证。旧书的流转情况不太确定，有消息我再联系您。"
    },
    {
      "id": "hermitage-20210611-01",
      "threadId": "hermitage-history",
      "groupId": "hermitage-20210611",
      "senderId": "luoyao-bookstore",
      "text": "宁先生您好，不好意思再打扰一下。"
    },
    {
      "id": "hermitage-20210611-03",
      "threadId": "hermitage-history",
      "groupId": "hermitage-20210611",
      "senderId": "luoyao-bookstore",
      "text": "我又查到一段转引，里面提到*「寄岁补年」*和*「借命续途」*。"
    },
    {
      "id": "hermitage-20210611-04",
      "threadId": "hermitage-history",
      "groupId": "hermitage-20210611",
      "senderId": "luoyao-bookstore",
      "text": "这两个是同一种方法吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": "hermitage-20210611-v23-1",
      "threadId": "hermitage-history",
      "groupId": "hermitage-20210611",
      "senderId": "hermitage",
      "text": "不是。按《续算杂录》里的说法，寄岁补年是续上短暂年岁，借命续途则是更改完整命籍，不能混为一谈。"
    },
    {
      "id": "hermitage-20210611-v23-2",
      "threadId": "hermitage-history",
      "groupId": "hermitage-20210611",
      "senderId": "luoyao-bookstore",
      "text": "但两者似乎可以同时使用。"
    },
    {
      "id": "hermitage-20210611-v23-3",
      "threadId": "hermitage-history",
      "groupId": "hermitage-20210611",
      "senderId": "hermitage",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "hermitage-20210611-v23-4",
      "threadId": "hermitage-history",
      "groupId": "hermitage-20210611",
      "senderId": "hermitage",
      "text": "您的意思是？"
    },
    {
      "id": "hermitage-20210611-v23-5",
      "threadId": "hermitage-history",
      "groupId": "hermitage-20210611",
      "senderId": "luoyao-bookstore",
      "text": "如果补足了年岁，之后是不是还需要借命续途？"
    },
    {
      "id": "hermitage-20210611-v23-6",
      "threadId": "hermitage-history",
      "groupId": "hermitage-20210611",
      "senderId": "hermitage",
      "text": "这个我不敢确定。目前能找到的引文不完整，两者具体是什么关系，还得核对原书。"
    },
    {
      "id": "hermitage-20210611-v23-7",
      "threadId": "hermitage-history",
      "groupId": "hermitage-20210611",
      "senderId": "luoyao-bookstore",
      "text": "我只是做理论上的假设，而且寄岁与借命若是结合在一起，恐怕需要按双方实足年龄之差核算。不是按虚岁，也不能只看周岁的整数。"
    },
    {
      "id": "hermitage-20210611-v23-8",
      "threadId": "hermitage-history",
      "groupId": "hermitage-20210611",
      "senderId": "hermitage",
      "text": "对，神秘学上的仪式必须精确到出生年月日。"
    },
    {
      "id": "hermitage-20210611-v23-9",
      "threadId": "hermitage-history",
      "groupId": "hermitage-20210611",
      "senderId": "luoyao-bookstore",
      "text": "明白了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "hermitage-20210611-13",
      "threadId": "hermitage-history",
      "groupId": "hermitage-20210611",
      "senderId": "hermitage",
      "text": "罗先生，您要研究这方面，不要只凭网上的说法判断。"
    },
    {
      "id": "hermitage-20210611-15",
      "threadId": "hermitage-history",
      "groupId": "hermitage-20210611",
      "senderId": "hermitage",
      "text": "而且，生命可贵，切勿因为这些玄学之谈做出后悔一生的事。"
    },
    {
      "id": "hermitage-20210611-16",
      "threadId": "hermitage-history",
      "groupId": "hermitage-20210611",
      "senderId": "luoyao-bookstore",
      "text": "宁先生，你也从未问过我为什么要找这些，但一直在帮我，想必也猜到了些什么。"
    },
    {
      "id": "hermitage-20210611-17",
      "threadId": "hermitage-history",
      "groupId": "hermitage-20210611",
      "senderId": "luoyao-bookstore",
      "text": "*我现在真的非常着急。*"
    },
    {
      "id": "hermitage-20210611-18",
      "threadId": "hermitage-history",
      "groupId": "hermitage-20210611",
      "senderId": "hermitage",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "hermitage-20210611-19",
      "threadId": "hermitage-history",
      "groupId": "hermitage-20210611",
      "senderId": "hermitage",
      "text": "敝店会尽力帮助您的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "hermitage-20210611-14",
      "threadId": "hermitage-history",
      "groupId": "hermitage-20210611",
      "senderId": "luoyao-bookstore",
      "text": "好的。那就拜托继续留意一下抄本消息了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "hermitage-20210618-01",
      "threadId": "hermitage-history",
      "groupId": "hermitage-20210618",
      "senderId": "hermitage",
      "text": "罗先生，之前您问的《续算杂录》卷三、四已经到店了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "hermitage-20210618-02",
      "threadId": "hermitage-history",
      "groupId": "hermitage-20210618",
      "senderId": "luoyao-bookstore",
      "text": "真的？！是完整的吗？来源可靠吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": "hermitage-20210618-03",
      "threadId": "hermitage-history",
      "groupId": "hermitage-20210618",
      "senderId": "hermitage",
      "text": "不是全本，只有部分章节。原书并不在国内，是雨沐斋主人托人扫描来的复印版。具体抄写年代店主还在核对。"
    },
    {
      "id": "hermitage-20210618-03-english",
      "threadId": "hermitage-history",
      "groupId": "hermitage-20210618",
      "senderId": "hermitage",
      "text": "此外，她也托朋友找到了一部分可相互印证的英文典籍，多次转译后会与原始文言文有些出入，但是已经足够解答您想问的问题了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "hermitage-20210618-06",
      "threadId": "hermitage-history",
      "groupId": "hermitage-20210618",
      "senderId": "hermitage",
      "text": "如果您方便，可以找时间来店里看看资料。届时，店主也会亲自和您聊聊的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "hermitage-20210618-07",
      "threadId": "hermitage-history",
      "groupId": "hermitage-20210618",
      "senderId": "luoyao-bookstore",
      "text": "非常感谢，我马上处理完手头的事就过来一趟。"
    },
    {
      "id": "hermitage-20210618-08",
      "threadId": "hermitage-history",
      "groupId": "hermitage-20210618",
      "senderId": "hermitage",
      "text": "可以，来之前联系一下就行。"
    },
    {
      "id": "hermitage-20210618-09",
      "threadId": "hermitage-history",
      "groupId": "hermitage-20210618",
      "senderId": "luoyao-bookstore",
      "text": "谢谢您，这段时间麻烦了。真的非常感谢。"
    },
    {
      "id": "hermitage-20210618-10",
      "threadId": "hermitage-history",
      "groupId": "hermitage-20210618",
      "senderId": "hermitage",
      "text": "不客气。"
    }
  ]
}
